"\n"
"Hello {{user_name}},\n"
"\n"
"Thank you for your payment of **{{payment_amount}} {{currency}}** for invoice {{invoice_number}}.\n"
"\n"
"- Confirmation: {{confirmation_number}}\n"
"- Payment date: {{payment_date}}\n"
"- Payment method: {{payment_method}}\n"
"- Transaction: {{transaction_number}}\n"
"\n"
"**Balance**\n"
"\n"
"- Invoice total: {{invoice_total}} {{currency}}\n"
"- Total paid: {{total_paid}} {{currency}}\n"
"- **Remaining balance: {{remaining_balance}} {{currency}}**\n"
msgstr "## Оплату отримано\n\nВітаємо, {{user_name}}!\n\nДякуємо за оплату **{{payment_amount}} {{currency}}** за рахунком {{invoice_number}}.\n\n- Підтвердження: {{confirmation_number}}\n- Дата оплати: {{payment_date}}\n- Спосіб оплати: {{payment_method}}\n- Транзакція: {{transaction_number}}\n\n**Баланс**\n\n- Сума рахунку: {{invoice_total}} {{currency}}\n- Усього сплачено: {{total_paid}} {{currency}}\n- **Залишок до сплати: {{remaining_balance}} {{currency}}**\n"

